:: Ben Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You have taken a seat with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> and are chatting with him. <span style="color:Pink">You are telling him about something or other when he suddenly lets out a loud, adorable yawn. Immediately the boy blushes and covers his face.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m sorry, I’m sorry!”</span> He says in a panic, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m not bored or uninterested or anything, I swear!”</span> You laugh, saying that you didn’t think that. You reassure the boy with a pat on the back. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, haha. I guess it’s getting pretty tired. Close to bedtime, and all that. I should really be heading home. Got to get ready for bed and have dinner and… yeah…”</span><br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Ben",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Happy",
            Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> stands up and collects his things, you find yourself yawning as well. You blame him for spreading his tired infection to you and you both laugh. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, yawns aren’t really a tired thing. Though they are contagious, in fact-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> looks like he’s about to ramble but stops himself, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, lesson for another time. Heh.”</span><br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Say goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You wave goodbye and tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> you’ll see him tomorrow. The boy waves back and walks off towards his house. <span style="color:LightGreen">You spot him yawning at least once more and laugh, turning and heading off yourself.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Surprise hug and kiss goodnight<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> turns around to leave, you suddenly surprise him with a big, tight hug from behind. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> makes a squeaking noise and jumps.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ah! Wha- what are you doing!?”</span> He says, his body becoming as stiff as a board. You laugh and tell him that you just wanted to give him a hug and kiss goodnight, <span style="color:Pink">planting one right on his cheek.</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                    },
                },
                {
                Name: "Ben",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 2,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> turns even redder, quickly wiggling out of your grasp and rubbing his cheek in embarrassment. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I… I…”</span> He stutters out, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I got to go!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> quickly runs off, embarrassed, as you laugh at how cute the boy can be sometimes.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
